@startuml
title APT-SD-D03 Terminal Trust Boundary and Device Identity Model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Terminal boundary" {
  component "Terminal device identity" as Device
  component "Cashier/operator identity" as Cashier
  component "Shift/session context" as Shift
  component "Assigned Site/Site Group" as Scope
  component "Workflow UI state" as UI
  component "Peripheral boundary\nscanner / camera / printer / cash drawer" as Peripherals
}

package "Trusted core platform" {
  component "Identity / RBAC / device trust" as Identity
  component "Central PMS" as Central
  component "Audit / Event" as Audit
}

Device --> Identity : trust evaluation
Cashier --> Identity : authentication
Shift --> Identity : shift validation
Scope --> Central : scope binding
UI --> Central : workflow request + context
Peripherals --> UI : controlled input/output only
Identity --> Audit : trust and identity events
Central --> Audit : workflow context

note bottom
Device possession and cashier login are prerequisites.
They do not transfer payment, fiscal, discount, or exit authority.
end note
@enduml
